  "body": "## Summary\n\n```diff\ndoc/\n+└── 2026-11-08T13-45-00Z_design_router_edge/\n+    └── ...design_router_edge.md  # Mono edge design, IPv6/#1280, Deco, six decisions\n└── README.md                     # catalog entry\n```\n\nPromotes the #6649 research into a durable design record. It preserves Drew's WAN-on-a-VLAN and identical dual-router intent, but recommends a single physical SFP+ trunk because ASK hardware offload declines VLANs over Linux bonds. It also documents the IPv6/PMTUD path, recommends demoting the Deco mesh to AP-only, and names six decisions with options and recommendations.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- **Before:** the research lived in a laptop burn folder; `doc/network-topology.md` specified VLANs on SFP+ bonds; no dedicated IPv6 or Deco sections or named decision list existed.\n- **After:** the repo record identifies the Mono Gateway Development Kits from inventory, explains the bond/offload tradeoff, includes IPv6 and Deco sections, and records decisions D1–D6. The existing topology is explicitly called out for later reconciliation rather than silently rewritten here.\n- `git diff --cached --check` passed; the new `doc/README.md` link resolves. This docs-only change needs no build/test suite; PR checks will be reported as they run.\n\n## Merge Danger\n\n**Door:** Two-way\n\n**Blast Radius:** Small\n\nDocumentation only. No router configuration, triggers, or live network behavior changes. The record is a proposal; Drew's decisions and post-cutover verification remain outstanding.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796737660&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7712&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7712&signature=de691a6e1f7adecf31986d6b6179583dd63d5e9f0ca5a0445401297d3aad3ba3\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7712?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
